TrueNAS Companion includes a modified copy of the Termux terminal-emulator and terminal-view libraries.

Source: https://github.com/termux/termux-app (tag v0.118.0), directories terminal-emulator/ and terminal-view/
Originally based on Jack Palevich's Android Terminal Emulator (https://github.com/jackpal/Android-Terminal-Emulator).
