is NOT included here.

Copyright (c) the Termux developers and contributors.
Copyright (c) Jack Palevich and the Android Terminal Emulator contributors.

Modifications by TrueNAS Companion (2026):
- TerminalSession no longer starts a local process through JNI/pty. It is attached to a remote byte stream
  (the TrueNAS web shell WebSocket): input goes to a Transport, output is passed in with feed(), and size changes
  are forwarded to Transport.resize(). JNI.java and the native code were removed.
- Both libraries are built as one Gradle module.
